* 18-ref-lib-section.lib - trimmed reference selecting one section of a corners library
* SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
* Written for the Omnia P0.3 spike. Generic parameters, no vendor data.
.lib "inc/corners.lib" TT
.subckt REF_TRIMMED OUT GND PARAMS: VNOM=1.2
VREF OUT N1 {VNOM+VREF_TRIM}
D1 N1 GND DREF_TT
.ends REF_TRIMMED
